  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcCanvas: {fileID: 1288077106}
  npcText: {fileID: 760781578}
  npcCharacter: {fileID: 670630699}
  fadeSpeed: 0.5
  messageDisplayDuration: 10
  pauseBetweenMessages: 1
  instructionPart1: Looks like when the power went out the ships navigation system
    went off course. Hmm... the yellow platforms seem to have some gravity device
    on them, you won't be able to activate your anti-gravity mechanism there.
  instructionPart2: Match the wire colors to the box colors. Connect all three pairs
    to open the door. Drag from one box to another using the hinges to get there.
    Make sure your wires don't get tangled with each other or intersect with the
    walls!
  instructionPart3: 'Try thinking of it like this: blue on top, red in the middle,
    and yellow on the bottom...'
  victoryMessage: Great! You got the ship back on course!! Let's get out of here,
    woof!
  messageSound: {fileID: 0}
  hintSound: {fileID: 0}
  victorySound: {fileID: 0}
